{"seq":27,"slug":"game-localization","title":"游戏本地化","stage":"DONE","category":"game-development","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-localization","rating":{"composite":3.66,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"游戏本地化\">游戏本地化</h1><p>一款只有英文界面的游戏，无论玩法多出色，都把全球绝大多数潜在玩家挡在门外。截至 2026 年 3 月的 Steam 语言调查里，英语与简体中文长期并列前两位，而日语、俄语、西班牙语、葡萄牙语（巴西）的合计份额同样可观——本地化早已不是「锦上添花的翻译」，而是决定一款游戏能否进入某个市场的硬门槛。本 hub 讲的就是：如何把一款为单一语言、单一文化设计的游戏，系统性地改造成能在多个语言与文化环境里自然运行的产品。</p>\n<p>很多团队对本地化的第一印象是「把字符串扔给翻译公司」。这种理解会在上线前两周变成灾难：UI 被德语长单词撑爆、日文字体框里全是豆腐块、俄语复数显示成「3 苹果」、阿拉伯语界面整个镜像错乱。真正的本地化是一条贯穿引擎、构建管线、内容生产与质量保障的工程链路，它要在写第一行 UI 代码时就开始，而不是在发行前才补。</p>\n<p>本 hub 把这条链路拆成四条递进的主线。第一条是<strong>基础</strong>：先厘清「国际化（i18n）」与「本地化（l10n）」的分工——前者是让代码具备适配多语言的能力，后者是针对具体语言文化做适配；再讲文本如何从代码里剥离成字符串表，以及文化适配要做到哪个层级。这是后面一切的地基，地基没打好，再多工具也救不回来。</p>\n<p>第二条是<strong>技术实现</strong>：当文本已经外部化之后，引擎层面真正要解决的硬骨头——多语言字体与渲染（CJK 字形、RTL 双向文本、字体回退）、文本扩展导致的 UI 自适应、以及复数与性别这类语法变体。这一条最容易被低估，却是 bug 最密集的地带。</p>\n<p>第三条是<strong>内容本地化</strong>：超越纯文本的部分——配音与字幕的同步与分级、图像/贴图/音频等资源的区域化替换、以及用术语库与翻译记忆保证跨数万条字符串的一致性。第四条是<strong>工程实践</strong>：把前三条落进可重复的流程——本地化的工具链与协作平台、上线前的本地化质量保障（LQA），以及让翻译跟上敏捷迭代的持续本地化与众包模式。</p>\n<p>四条主线层层递进：基础决定能不能做，技术决定做得对不对，内容决定做得全不全，实践决定做得快不快、稳不稳。读完本 hub，你应当能为一款新游戏从零规划本地化架构，也能诊断一款已上线游戏的本地化问题出在链路的哪一环。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-localization/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"localization-vs-internationalization","title":"本地化与国际化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-localization/foundations/localization-vs-internationalization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"text-externalization","title":"文本外部化与字符串表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-localization/foundations/text-externalization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cultural-adaptation","title":"文化适配与本地化层级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-localization/foundations/cultural-adaptation"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"technical","title":"技术实现","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-localization/technical","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fonts-multilingual-rendering","title":"字体与多语言渲染","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-localization/technical/fonts-multilingual-rendering"},{"seq":2,"slug":"text-expansion-ui","title":"文本扩展与 UI 适配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-localization/technical/text-expansion-ui"},{"seq":3,"slug":"plural-gender-grammar","title":"复数与性别语法变体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-localization/technical/plural-gender-grammar"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"content","title":"内容本地化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-localization/content","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"voiceover-subtitles","title":"配音与字幕","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-localization/content/voiceover-subtitles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"asset-image-localization","title":"资源与图像本地化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-localization/content/asset-image-localization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"terminology-translation-memory","title":"术语库与翻译记忆","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-localization/content/terminology-translation-memory"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-localization/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"localization-workflow-tools","title":"本地化流程与工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-localization/practice/localization-workflow-tools"},{"seq":2,"slug":"lqa-testing","title":"本地化测试 LQA","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-localization/practice/lqa-testing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"continuous-localization","title":"持续本地化与众包","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-localization/practice/continuous-localization"}]}]}